      "revenue sharing can be configured in rate plans so developers receive a configured percentage of total generated revenue",
      "monetization now supports data residency to specify the geographic regions where monetization data is stored",
      "monetization rate plans now support banded consumption fees applying different fees per api consumption band",
      "monetization now supports exporting additional fee based values for organizations in report output",
      "monetization now supports an optional setup fee that can be charged to new api developers",
